OL,3,ATrump says FBI investigating Nvidia
OL,4,Aboss's affair with alleged Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said the
OL,7,FFBI is investigating the affair between
OL,8,Fthe chief executive of Nvidia and an
OL,9,Falleged Chinese spy.
OL,11,FTrump said he spoke to Jensen Huang on
OL,12,FMonday following reports that the US
OL,13,Fbelieved he had been targeted in a
OL,14,FChinese espionage campaign.
OL,16,F"I asked him that question, 'Did you
OL,17,Fhave any idea she was a spy?' He said
OL,18,F'I had no idea she was a spy' and I
OL,19,Freally believe him," Trump told
OL,20,Freporters.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794275657
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATrump says FBI investigating Nvidia
OL,4,Aboss's affair with alleged Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeijing has rejected claims that Huang
OL,7,Fwas targeted, with its foreign ministry
OL,8,Fsaying the allegations were "entirely
OL,9,Fgroundless, speculative and intended to
OL,10,Fsmear and malign China".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
