OL,3,AQantas to outsource 850 local jobs with
OL,4,Amost roles moving to India
OL,5,
OL,6,FQantas will outsource 850 local
OL,7,Fcorporate jobs to consulting giant
OL,8,FAccenture with most roles moving to
OL,9,FIndia as the airline fast-tracks AI
OL,10,Finvestment.
OL,12,FIn an internal email to staff on
OL,13,FTuesday, the Australian company's CEO
OL,14,FVanessa Hudson said "this is hard news
OL,15,Ffor some and I'm sorry for the
OL,16,Funcertainty it brings".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794275657
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AQantas to outsource 850 local jobs with
OL,4,Amost roles moving to India
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe job cuts will begin mid-2027, she
OL,7,Fsaid, and start with finance,
OL,8,Fprocurement, people and marketing roles
OL,9,Fshifting "mostly" to teams in India and
OL,10,F"some in Australia" as the firm seeks
OL,11,Fto modernise its IT systems.
OL,13,FHudson said the "scale and speed of
OL,14,Fchange in technology and AI is
OL,15,Fsomething none of us has seen in our
OL,16,Flifetime", and it was in talks with
OL,17,Funions and staff on the plans.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
