OL,3,AJames Bond: What we know so far about
OL,4,Athe next 007 film
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen a bartender asked James Bond in
OL,7,F2006's Casino Royale whether he'd like
OL,8,Fhis vodka martini shaken or stirred,
OL,9,Fthe irritated spy replied: "Do I look
OL,10,Flike I give a damn?"
OL,12,FSuch throwaway lines were a clever way
OL,13,Fof signalling to the audience that this
OL,14,Fwas a new era for 007 - and that the
OL,15,Ffilm series launched in 1962 was being
OL,16,Foverhauled with the arrival of Daniel
OL,17,FCraig.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794275657
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJames Bond: What we know so far about
OL,4,Athe next 007 film
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the next few films, producers
OL,7,Fstruck a balance between nodding to the
OL,8,Fpast while also moving away from some
OL,9,Fof the cheesier elements of the series,
OL,10,Fno longer sticking rigidly to all of
OL,11,Fthe tradition and tropes of Bond.
OL,13,F"Were you expecting an exploding pen?"
OL,14,FBen Whishaw's Q later asked the secret
OL,15,Fservice agent in Skyfall. "We don't
OL,16,Freally go in for that anymore."
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
